          "text": "The user is asking for log information analysis dimensions and how to analyze TOKEN consumption, usage depth, and usage habits in an enterprise setting as a manager.\n\nThis is a conceptual/business question about analyzing AI usage logs in an enterprise context. I should provide a structured response covering:\n1. What dimensions can be analyzed from logs\n2. How to analyze TOKEN consumption, usage depth, and usage habits\n3. How managers can use this for work analysis\n\nLet me think about what log data would typically be available from an AI coding platform like this one, and what metrics would be relevant for enterprise management.\n\nI should give a comprehensive but practical answer.",
